      "id": "claim_84c087f65f2749b8bf613b47f43f37ee",
      "statement": "The release-please manifest has nine independently released package baselines—Deep Agents 0.7.35, ACP 0.0.13, Code 0.2.7, Talon 0.1.0, Daytona 0.0.9, Modal 0.0.7, Runloop 0.0.7, Vercel 0.0.2, and QuickJS 0.3.12—and configuration creates separate draft Python release PRs with pre-1.0 bump behavior while delegating publication to release.yml.",
